{"5067320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Submarine Together", "steam_appid": 5067320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROL THE SUBMARINE TOGETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Submarine Together</i> is a 2-player co-op game where you must work together to control a single submarine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are split between two players:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player 1:</strong> Controls UP / DOWN</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player 2:</strong> Controls LEFT / RIGHT</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divided Controls:</strong> You can't steer alone. You need constant communication with your teammate to move in the right direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrow Tunnels &amp; Obstacles:</strong> Navigate through tight underwater pipes filled with moving mines, spiky traps, and sharp turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics &amp; Speed:</strong> Use speed boosts carefully. One wrong move will crash the submarine into the walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch &amp; Online Co-Op:</strong> Play together on the same screen or online with your friend.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROL THE SUBMARINE TOGETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Submarine Together</i> is a 2-player co-op game where you must work together to control a single submarine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are split between two players:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player 1:</strong> Controls UP / DOWN</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player 2:</strong> Controls LEFT / RIGHT</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divided Controls:</strong> You can't steer alone. You need constant communication with your teammate to move in the right direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrow Tunnels &amp; Obstacles:</strong> Navigate through tight underwater pipes filled with moving mines, spiky traps, and sharp turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics &amp; Speed:</strong> Use speed boosts carefully. One wrong move will crash the submarine into the walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch &amp; Online Co-Op:</strong> Play together on the same screen or online with your friend.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Submarine Together is a chaotic co-op game where two players control one submarine. Player 1 moves UP/DOWN, Player 2 moves LEFT/RIGHT. Coordinate with your friend, avoid obstacles in narrow underwater tubes, and try to reach the end without crashing!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067320/f738c4bde4e3dd7f1860910eea3b339b45d15b82/header.jpg?t=1788043220", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067320/e51623a5636012aac03e22f705923fb9f83a1fde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788043220", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067320/e51623a5636012aac03e22f705923fb9f83a1fde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788043220", "website": "https://nearlydonegames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 CPUs), ~3.1GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Intel(R) HD Graphics 520<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB avail